values
('20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','public-system-boundary','Public System Architecture','Sanitized relationship map showing platform clients, shared controls, the BFF boundary, and the ERP core.','architecture',
'{"groups":[{"id":"clients","label":"Client Platforms"},{"id":"controls","label":"Shared Controls"},{"id":"core","label":"Enterprise Core"}],"nodes":[{"id":"hr","label":"HR","group":"clients"},{"id":"sales","label":"Sales","group":"clients"},{"id":"web-commerce","label":"Web E-commerce","group":"clients"},{"id":"mobile-v2","label":"Mobile Apps V2","group":"clients"},{"id":"it-monitoring","label":"IT Monitoring","group":"clients"},{"id":"bff","label":"Golang Gin BFF","group":"controls","description":"Central orchestration boundary"},{"id":"authentication","label":"Authentication","group":"controls"},{"id":"validation","label":"Validation","group":"controls"},{"id":"rate-limiting","label":"Rate Limiting","group":"controls"},{"id":"orchestration","label":"Orchestration","group":"controls"},{"id":"errors","label":"Error Standardization","group":"controls"},{"id":"observability","label":"Observability","group":"controls"},{"id":"erp","label":"ERPNext / Frappe","group":"core"},{"id":"enterprise-services","label":"Data, Workflows & Operational Services","group":"core"}],"edges":[{"from":"hr","to":"bff","label":"Validated request"},{"from":"sales","to":"bff"},{"from":"web-commerce","to":"bff"},{"from":"mobile-v2","to":"bff"},{"from":"it-monitoring","to":"bff"},{"from":"bff","to":"erp","label":"Controlled integration"},{"from":"erp","to":"enterprise-services","label":"Operational source of truth"}]}'::jsonb,
'Five client platforms connect to a centralized Golang Gin BFF. The BFF applies authentication, validation, rate limiting, orchestration, error standardization, and observability before controlled integration with ERPNext/Frappe and its data, workflows, and operational services.',true,0),
('20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','decision-pipeline','Experimental Decision Pipeline','Public architecture for the educational routing simulation.','flow',
'{"groups":[{"id":"inputs","label":"Inputs"},{"id":"decisions","label":"Decision Systems"},{"id":"outputs","label":"Outputs"}],"nodes":[{"id":"route-graph","label":"Route Graph","group":"inputs"},{"id":"weather","label":"Weather Conditions","group":"inputs"},{"id":"courier-state","label":"Courier State","group":"inputs"},{"id":"bfs","label":"BFS","group":"decisions"},{"id":"a-star","label":"A*","group":"decisions"},{"id":"energy-model","label":"Energy Prediction Model","group":"decisions"},{"id":"minimax","label":"Minimax Decision Logic","group":"decisions"},{"id":"selected-route","label":"Selected Route","group":"outputs"},{"id":"risk-summary","label":"Risk Summary","group":"outputs"},{"id":"energy-estimate","label":"Energy Estimate","group":"outputs"},{"id":"map-view","label":"Map Visualization","group":"outputs"}],"edges":[{"from":"route-graph","to":"bfs"},{"from":"route-graph","to":"a-star"},{"from":"weather","to":"a-star"},{"from":"courier-state","to":"energy-model"},{"from":"courier-state","to":"minimax"},{"from":"bfs","to":"selected-route"},{"from":"a-star","to":"selected-route"},{"from":"weather","to":"risk-summary"},{"from":"energy-model","to":"energy-estimate"},{"from":"minimax","to":"map-view"}]}'::jsonb,
'Route graph, weather conditions, and courier state feed BFS, A-star, an energy prediction model, and Minimax decision logic. Outputs include a selected route, risk summary, energy estimate, and map visualization.',true,0)
